---@field labels? gcp.unstable.notebooks_v1.StringMap Optional. Labels to apply to this disk. These can be later modified by the disks.setLabels method. This field is only applicable for persistent disks.
---@field diskSizeGb? string Optional. Specifies the size of the disk in base-2 GB. If not specified, the disk will be the same size as the image (usually 10GB). If specified, the size must be equal to or larger than 10GB. Default 100 GB.
